      "receiptId": "fairy-butter.html-1",
      "receiptSource": "Original Receipt in \u0027\u003Ci\u003EThe Experienced English Housekeeper\u003C/i\u003E\u0027 by Elizabeth Raffald (\u003Ca href=\u0022references.html#raffald-1769\u0022\u003E\u003Cb\u003ERaffald 1769\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/a\u003E)",
      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003ETo make Fairy Butter.\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\n\u003Cbr\u003E\nTAKE the yolks of four eggs boiled hard, a quarter of a pound of butter, beat two ounces of sugar in a large spoonful of orange flower water, beat them all together to a fine paste, let it stand two or three hours, then rub it through a cullendar upon a plate; it looks very pretty.\u003Cbr\u003E"
    }
